+# Font Editor V2 — Add Text (experimental)
+
+- Select a registered full static TTF/OTF in Format text for new or previously added text.
+- Reuse the existing PDF embedding engine, real unshaped font advances, Unicode maps and editable content metadata.
+- Custom faces accept only supported WinAnsi characters in this version; no contextual shaping, variable fonts or synthetic bold/italic. Import each actual style face separately.
+- The UI preview loads the selected face into egui; preview parity, CFF/OTF compatibility and Windows runtime still require testing.
+- Imports are registered per page; select the imported face from the dropdown after import. The last selected style follows the existing reusable Add Text behavior.
+- Build and test in GitHub Actions. Source patch validation is not a successful Rust compilation.
+
+---
+
